<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU raises operating margin to 12.9 pct.</title>
<headline>VNU raises operating margin to 12.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU said on Tuesday it had raised its operating margin (operating profit as a percentage of sales) to 12.9 percent in 1996 from 11.6 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>In April 1996 VNU said it aimed gradually to raise its operating margin to 15 percent within four to five years.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
